{"id":"vod_md_3029","vodId":"3029","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"滑头鬼之孙国语版第一季","name_cn":"滑头鬼之孙国语版第一季","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"26集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230822-1/57e4d32e2bca2a4f3d7322bc5822237c.jpg"},"summary":"滑头鬼，是统领着百鬼夜行的妖怪总大将。十三岁的奴良陆生（福山润 配音）看似是一名普通中学生，喜欢着同班同学家长加奈（平野绫 配音）。但其实他有四分之一的妖怪血统，是大妖怪“滑头鬼”的孙子。他被 “奴良组”众妖怪尊称为少主，身边有个叫及川冰丽（崛江由衣 配音）的亲信。但他一心只想当一个普通人类，不肯承认自己是妖怪的事实，更不愿继承奴良组三代目之位。四年前一次意外，使他觉醒了妖怪之血，暂时恢复了妖怪的相貌，但是到了白天，他又变回了人类的模样并且还会忘记自己是妖怪这件事。自此以来，奴良陆生仍过着平静的人类生活。但其实自觉醒之日起，他便已经立下志愿要继承奴良组三代目，站在众鬼之巅，成为魑魅魍魉之主。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-22 08:49:58","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/DAYgq5QU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/69EZfsC1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/2wtwhF5W/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/bFaIpsew/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/8FegjTGN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/BHwvVP88/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/MHGH5Gap/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/VThNi3A3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/7ObAOZsw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/bUqMUeDA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/ODFsuD7U/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/J7K8OfUl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/dE385Xd7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/AYcMgnZP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/Twtfef